<title>USA: Omaha cattle $2.50/3.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle $2.50/3.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade on slaughter steers and heifers slow. Early sales ranged $2.50/3.00 lower than last Tuesday. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4, 1100-1350 lbs 68.50-69.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4, 1050-1200 lbs 68.50-69.00.</p>
</text>
